# Robot hardware pins (LOCKED)

## Motor drivers — DO NOT CHANGE

These pins and drive direction logic are verified working. Never modify:

| Motor | DIR | PWM |
|-------|-----|-----|
| LV | 11 | 10 |
| LN | 37 | 36 |
| RN | 1 | 2 |
| RV | 7 | 6 |

```cpp
#define DRIVER1_MOTOR1_DIR 11  // LV
#define DRIVER1_MOTOR1_PWM 10
#define DRIVER1_MOTOR2_DIR 37  // LN
#define DRIVER1_MOTOR2_PWM 36
#define DRIVER2_MOTOR1_DIR 1   // RN
#define DRIVER2_MOTOR1_PWM 2
#define DRIVER2_MOTOR2_DIR 7   // RV
#define DRIVER2_MOTOR2_PWM 6
```

Control: in/in driver — forward `DIR=0,PWM=speed`, reverse `DIR=|speed|,PWM=0`.

## Encoders (A, B)

| Motor | A | B |
|-------|---|---|
| LV | 40 | 39 |
| LN | 20 | 21 |
| RN | 41 | 42 |
| RV | 4 | 5 |
